                <pb facs="0108" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg6"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72119/5848: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate Peace to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-28"><hi rendition="#italic">July 28,
                            1919</hi></date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.34
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>3374. We desire to recall to your attention the question of the appointment of a
                    permanent American member of the Inter-Allied High Commission of the Rhenish
                    Territories under article 2 of the Rhineland arrangement. Mr. Pierrepont B.
                    Noyes is the American member at present. White. Bliss.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">American Mission</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
